# OpenTofu: provider downloads, drafts and saved plans never get committed. The encrypted state does
# (tofu/terraform.tfstate); the probe's state doesn't (design D7).
.terraform/
generated.tf
*.tfplan
tofu/probe/terraform.tfstate*
tofu/probe/terraform.tfvars
tofu/probe/README.probe.md
tofu/probe/.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate.backup

